Or some guy George Choofallo.
Chuffallo?

251
00:12:38.438 --> 00:12:40.713
George Chuvalo?
The boxer?

252
00:12:40.714 --> 00:12:42.264
I guess.

253
00:12:42.265 --> 00:12:44.816
