267
00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.954
Wasn't like I was gonna wear it.
I'm not even a Taurus.

268
00:13:17.955 --> 00:13:19.747
No. you wouldn't
wear that ring.

269
00:13:19.748 --> 00:13:22.300
It would clash with
your new orange jumpsuit.

270
00:13:23.093 --> 00:13:24.230
What?

271
00:13:24.231 --> 00:13:25.816
Pinked a job means

272
00:13:25.817 --> 00:13:27.678
he made a suit with great care.

273
00:13:27.679 --> 00:13:30.333
Hunch on the neck.
tennis elbow.

274
00:13:30.334 --> 00:13:32.437
Benny was a tailor.

275
00:13:32.438 --> 00:13:35.126
Yeah. maybe
the Lucky was a shop.

276
00:13:37.955 --> 00:13:39.368
Huh. Tom Ford.

277
00:13:39.369 --> 00:13:41.678
as we live and breathe.
- Who?

278
00:13:41.679 --> 00:13:43.920
Tom Ford. The. uh. tailor?
Designer?

279
00:13:43.921 --> 00:13:45.540
