286
00:13:59.679 --> 00:14:01.264
Come on. bro.
Some guy hands me cash

287
00:14:01.265 --> 00:14:03.851
to come in here and like--
- And like. you know. what?

288
00:14:03.852 --> 00:14:05.851
Keep the lights on.
don't burn the place down.

289
00:14:05.852 --> 00:14:08.299
Almost sounds like
a direct quote.

290
00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:10.713
Okay. cool. That's cool.

291
00:14:10.714 --> 00:14:13.747
Tell me. Joey.
just-just between us.

292
00:14:13.748 --> 00:14:16.713
where in the store
are you not allowed to go?

293
00:14:22.817 --> 00:14:25.127
Backup?

294
00:14:26.886 --> 00:14:28.645
Good talk.

295
00:14:37.403 --> 00:14:40.402
Look at that Judy.
the middle seams on them.

296
00:14:40.403 --> 00:14:43.058
What have we got?

297
00:14:50.058 --> 00:14:53.920
That's a Colt 1911.
It's a beautiful piece.

298
00:14:57.162 --> 00:14:59.403
Serial number's filed off.
tape on the grip.

299
00:15:01.024 --> 00:15:03.644
No fingerprints.
access to sports celebrities.

300
00:15:03.645 --> 00:15:05.920
It wasn't a bull
on Benny's ring.

301
00:15:05.921 --> 00:15:07.333
it was a cow with horns.

302
00:15:07.334 --> 00:15:09.540
A sign of strength
and equilibrium.

303
00:15:09.541 --> 00:15:11.230
You're thinking
our Benny's mafia?

304
00:15:11.231 --> 00:15:13.126
I am.

305
00:15:13.127 --> 00:15:15.540
And judging by his...

306
00:15:15.541 --> 00:15:18.747
...gun collection.
I think our Benny...

307
00:15:18.748 --> 00:15:20.748
was a hitman.

308
00:15:24.265 --> 00:15:25.989
Benjamin "Benny" Cohen.

309
00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:29.816
AKA Benny the Gent.
AKA the Mensch.

310
00:15:29.817 --> 00:15:32.023
Never married.
never had any kids.

311
00:15:32.024 --> 00:15:35.195
Gia said he used to talk about.
uh. a woman named Prim.

312
00:15:35.196 --> 00:15:36.954
Could be an ex-girlfriend.
but so far. we haven't found

313
00:15:36.955 --> 00:15:38.885
anyone with that name.
- Yup.

314
00:15:38.886 --> 00:15:41.092
First Jewish hitman
in the Toronto mob.

315
00:15:41.093 --> 00:15:44.195
I've been hearing stories
about Benny the Gent

316
00:15:44.196 --> 00:15:46.092
