317
00:15:46.093 --> 00:15:48.920
Kind of like the Boogie man
of the underworld.

318
00:15:48.921 --> 00:15:50.368
An old commander told me once

319
00:15:50.369 --> 00:15:52.092
that when Benny
was 20-something.

320
00:15:52.093 --> 00:15:53.851
a mob boss refused
to pay him.

321
00:15:53.852 --> 00:15:57.540
so Benny sneaks into
the mob boss' house.

322
00:15:57.541 --> 00:16:00.402
puts a gun next to his
sleeping son's head.

323
00:16:00.403 --> 00:16:02.678
