Boss comes running in.

324
00:16:02.679 --> 00:16:06.023
Benny looks at him and says.
"That's an extra zero

325
00:16:06.024 --> 00:16:09.333
on the end of what you owe me.
How rich do you wanna make me?"

326
00:16:09.334 --> 00:16:11.471
This is exactly
why it's gonna be hard

327
00:16:11.472 --> 00:16:14.747
to narrow down a suspect.
Benny was a person of interest

328
00:16:14.748 --> 00:16:17.816
in at least 15 murders
over the course of 40 years.

329
00:16:17.817 --> 00:16:21.230
It's a lot of bad blood.
a lot of underworld debt to pay.

330
00:16:21.231 --> 00:16:24.299
But since 2015. we have nothing
on Benny Cohen.

331
00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:28.161
Find out which of our guys
has eyes on the Calabrian Mafia.

332
00:16:28.162 --> 00:16:30.195
And see if they can narrow down
who exactly

333
00:16:30.196 --> 00:16:31.885
would want this man dead.

334
00:16:34.921 --> 00:16:37.368
I mean. as far as we know.
uh. Benny stopped working

335
00:16:37.369 --> 00:16:39.333
for the mob nine. 10 years ago.

336
00:16:39.334 --> 00:16:41.264
Nobody's hired a hitman
in a wheelchair.

337
00:16:41.265 --> 00:16:42.782
Detective Novak.

338
00:16:42.783 --> 00:16:44.437
if you were to take
a wild guess.

339
00:16:44.438 --> 00:16:46.885
which one of these guys
would want Benny dead

340
00:16:46.886 --> 00:16:49.747
after all of these years?
- None of 'em.

341
00:16:49.748 --> 00:16:51.299
That's the thing.
they're all getting older.

342
00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:52.954
moving to Florida.
Calabrians have been

343
00:16:52.955 --> 00:16:54.575
very quiet lately.

344
00:16:54.576 --> 00:16:56.506
Well. it's unlike
the mafia to bear a grudge.

345
00:16:56.507 --> 00:16:59.299
Sure.
But Benny. Benny's freelance.

346
00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:02.023
He worked for all four leaders
of the Calabrian mafia

347
00:17:02.024 --> 00:17:03.954
in Toronto. You think
your answer's up there?

348
00:17:03.955 --> 00:17:06.540
You have to talk
to all those guys.

349
00:17:06.541 --> 00:17:09.471
But. here's a word to the wise.

350
00:17:09.472 --> 00:17:11.368
no one's gonna admit
to even knowing Benny.

351
00:17:11.369 --> 00:17:13.714
Let alone employing him.

352
00:17:15.024 --> 00:17:16.989
You want one
of the big boys to talk?

353
00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:19.299
You need to prove he had
a solid connection to Benny

354
00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.023
and I mean. concrete.

355
00:17:21.024 --> 00:17:23.402
That's not going to be easy.

356
00:17:23.403 --> 00:17:25.540
This is why criminals
love Canada.

357
00:17:25.541 --> 00:17:28.230
We are one of the most opaque
jurisdictions in the world

358
00:17:28.231 --> 00:17:30.782
when it comes to identifying
the president of a company.

359
00:17:30.783 --> 00:17:32.851
numbered company
owned by numbered company.

360
00:17:32.852 --> 00:17:34.885
Another title search.
another ghost.

361
00:17:34.886 --> 00:17:36.782
All we need
is a connection to Benny.

362
00:17:36.783 --> 00:17:38.609
If-if we can find

363
00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.437
any kind of payment.
we can cross reference it

364
00:17:40.438 --> 00:17:41.989
with mob-style killings
at the same time.

365
00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.954
Okay. but without
a clear paper trail.

366
00:17:43.955 --> 00:17:46.126
I won't be able to tell
which family paid what.

367
00:17:46.127 --> 00:17:47.989
We need to put names
to these numbers.

368
00:17:49.886 --> 00:17:51.747
Hey.

369
00:17:51.748 --> 00:17:54.057
Look. I just wanted
to say. uh...

370
00:17:54.058 --> 00:17:56.333
And maybe
it's none of my business.

371
00:17:56.334 --> 00:17:58.989
but. um. if you ever

372
00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:01.126
