or you wanted to talk.

373
00:18:01.127 --> 00:18:02.885
I'm here. okay?

374
00:18:02.886 --> 00:18:05.368
You know that right?

375
00:18:05.369 --> 00:18:07.782
It's dementia.
Early onset.

376
00:18:07.783 --> 00:18:09.816
Oh. God. Mark.
I'm so sorry.

377
00:18:09.817 --> 00:18:11.506
You know.
it just happened so quickly.

378
00:18:11.507 --> 00:18:13.299
One day. she's living
an independent life.

379
00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:15.161
the next she's stuck
in the middle of the 401

380
00:18:15.162 --> 00:18:16.816
