remember how to drive.

381
00:18:16.817 --> 00:18:18.678
Jesus. Geez...

382
00:18:18.679 --> 00:18:19.989
How's she doing now?

383
00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:22.126
She's forgotten
most of the basics.

384
00:18:22.127 --> 00:18:25.333
Names. dates. doesn't even
remember me half the time.

385
00:18:25.334 --> 00:18:27.126
My brother and I compete
with each other

386
00:18:27.127 --> 00:18:28.747
