to say our names.

387
00:18:28.748 --> 00:18:30.437
He sings her Abba.

388
00:18:30.438 --> 00:18:33.092
I bring her Baskin Robbins
praline & cream.

389
00:18:33.093 --> 00:18:34.989
Once in a while.
she remembers us.

390
00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:38.369
Says. "Thank you. baby."
or "I love you. Mark."

391
00:18:39.541 --> 00:18:41.989
Makes everything worth it.

392
00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:43.299
Hey.

393
00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.782
Just got. uh. Benny's
bank records released.

394
00:18:45.783 --> 00:18:47.816
Should be up on the server.

395
00:18:47.817 --> 00:18:49.782
Okay. now we're talking.

396
00:18:49.783 --> 00:18:51.368
Huh.

397
00:18:51.369 --> 00:18:54.299
$10.000 deposited monthly
going back years.

398
00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.713
The last deposit was a week ago.

399
00:18:55.714 --> 00:18:57.713
Depositor?

400
00:18:57.714 --> 00:18:58.954
Numbered company.

401
00:18:58.955 --> 00:19:01.368
surprise. surprise.
No name attached.

402
00:19:01.369 --> 00:19:04.057
but it was briefly set up at
a retail space in Mississauga.

403
00:19:04.058 --> 00:19:05.920
And it was sold by...

404
00:19:05.921 --> 00:19:08.506
agent's name is Matteo Galatti.

405
00:19:08.507 --> 00:19:10.264
Galatti.

406
00:19:10.265 --> 00:19:12.713
Son of mob boss Dario Galatti?

407
00:19:12.714 --> 00:19:15.783
AKA Il Macellaio.

408
00:19:16.403 --> 00:19:18.230
The Butcher.
His signature dish

409
00:19:18.231 --> 00:19:20.782
