into a chatty Kathy.

418
00:19:36.886 --> 00:19:39.264
Hey. buddy. You better
get your story straight.

419
00:19:39.265 --> 00:19:41.093
Homicide is sniffing around.

420
00:19:55.921 --> 00:19:57.954
You put it up like this
with your right hand.

421
00:19:57.955 --> 00:19:59.885
this hand. you turn it
toward you.

422
00:19:59.886 --> 00:20:02.782
And with your left hand. you
turn it away from you. alright?

423
00:20:04.645 --> 00:20:07.230
Detectives. you could've called.
I would've answered.

424
00:20:07.231 --> 00:20:09.471
Ah. we saw that
the shop was open.

425
00:20:09.472 --> 00:20:11.713
Took the chance you'd be here.
I'm a little peckish.

426
00:20:11.714 --> 00:20:14.747
So. uh. the murder police
show up unannounced.

427
00:20:14.748 --> 00:20:18.264
while I'm working with my family
with a line down the block.

428
00:20:18.265 --> 00:20:20.713
You know. people could start
thinking the wrong thing.

429
00:20:20.714 --> 00:20:22.195
Oh. what would
the wrong thing be?

430
00:20:22.196 --> 00:20:24.437
That a bakery
used to be a butcher?

431
00:20:24.438 --> 00:20:26.023
Il macellaio.

432
00:20:26.024 --> 00:20:28.886
Sofia. <i>belleza.</i>
Come. my dear.

433
00:20:32.438 --> 00:20:34.678
- So what can I do for you?
