439
00:20:47.058 --> 00:20:49.540
So you know who I am. huh?

440
00:20:49.541 --> 00:20:53.299
If that were true.
you'd know that Benny and me.

441
00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:54.609
we were like brothers--

442
00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:56.195
Well. Cain and Abel
were brothers.

443
00:20:57.921 --> 00:21:00.264
Well. if Abel
saved Cain's life.

444
00:21:00.265 --> 00:21:02.540
then things would've
turned out different for them.

445
00:21:02.541 --> 00:21:04.093
What. so Benny
saved your life?

446
00:21:05.093 --> 00:21:06.644
Matter of fact. he did.

447
00:21:06.645 --> 00:21:08.471
10 years ago.
I had a home invasion.

448
00:21:08.472 --> 00:21:11.713
These-these two lowlifes tied up
me and my son. Matteo.

449
00:21:11.714 --> 00:21:14.506
and they robbed us. And when
they figured out who I was...

450
00:21:14.507 --> 00:21:16.816
They couldn't risk
leaving you alive.

451
00:21:16.817 --> 00:21:19.333
Exactly.
And if Benny hadn't shown up

452
00:21:19.334 --> 00:21:21.471
exactly when he did...

453
00:21:21.472 --> 00:21:24.575
So I have nothing
but love for that man.

454
00:21:24.576 --> 00:21:27.299
So much so that I pulled strings

455
00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:30.609
and I paid to put him
in a private care home

456
00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:32.609
when he couldn't walk
properly anymore.

457
00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:34.816
Well. you also paid him
10 grand a month

458
00:21:34.817 --> 00:21:36.678
for the last 10 years.

459
00:21:36.679 --> 00:21:38.402
The numbered company
that paid Benny

460
00:21:38.403 --> 00:21:41.126
