that your son sold.

461
00:21:41.127 --> 00:21:42.678
My son is a real estate agent.

462
00:21:42.679 --> 00:21:45.679
He has nothing to do
with my business.

463
00:21:46.472 --> 00:21:48.126
Nothing.
- When was the last time

464
00:21:48.127 --> 00:21:50.644
you saw Benny? Did you ever
visit him in his suite?

465
00:21:50.645 --> 00:21:52.885
- I don't remember.
- You don't remember?

466
00:21:52.886 --> 00:21:54.368
Oh. that's an interesting
choice of words.

467
00:21:54.369 --> 00:21:56.851
considering Benny was suffering
from dementia.

468
00:21:56.852 --> 00:21:58.885
Benny had dementia?

469
00:21:58.886 --> 00:22:00.989
Yeah. and you know what?
We heard it was starting

470
00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:02.678
to make him
a little bit talkative.

471
00:22:02.679 --> 00:22:04.851
I don't know. maybe you
had some secrets with him

472
00:22:04.852 --> 00:22:06.852
